  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.DragonBreath": "The creature exhales destructive energy in a cone or line. Creatures in the area attempt a basic Reflex save against the listed DC.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.FrightfulPresence": "The creature's mere presence shakes its foes. Creatures in the area must attempt a Will save against the listed DC or become frightened.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.VoidHealing": "This creature is healed by void energy and harmed by vitality energy.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.GraveChill": "The creature touches a target with grave-cold power. The target takes the listed cold damage and must attempt a Fortitude save against the listed DC.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.InfernalCurse": "The creature curses a target with infernal power. The target must attempt a Will save against the listed DC or take a penalty to its rolls.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.RadiantAid": "The creature fills an ally with holy power, granting temporary Hit Points or a brief protective bonus.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.ConstructBody": "This creature has an artificial body. It is resistant to many bodily needs and effects.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.TricksterGlamour": "The creature twists a foe's perception with fey magic, making itself harder to hit.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.FireBurst": "The creature releases a sudden eruption of fire. Creatures in the area take the listed fire damage with a basic Reflex save against the listed DC.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.FreezingAura": "An aura of supernatural cold surrounds the creature. Nearby foes take cold damage or are slowed.",

