  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.Regeneration": "The creature regains Hit Points at the start of its turn. An appropriate damage type can suppress this regeneration until the start of its next turn.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.Aura": "The creature is surrounded by a supernatural aura. Enemies within the aura must attempt a Will save against the listed DC or suffer the described effect.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.DeathBurst": "When the creature is destroyed or killed, it explodes in a burst of destructive energy. Creatures in the area attempt a basic Reflex save against the listed DC.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.PackTactics": "The creature fights especially well alongside allies. It gains benefits when an ally threatens or attacks the same enemy.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.SwallowWhole": "The creature attempts to swallow a grabbed target. The target must attempt a Fortitude save against the listed DC or be swallowed.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.Teleport": "The creature magically teleports to a nearby location it can see.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.Invisibility": "The creature briefly becomes invisible or obscures its exact position.",
  "PF2EMF.AbilityDescriptions.Spellcasting": "The creature has innate or prepared spells. Choose appropriate spells based on the creature's theme, tradition, and level.",

